      "id": 1,
      "title": "HOME AUTOMATION ANDROID APPLICATION USING ARDUINO",
      "abstract": "The Home Automation Android Application Using Arduino is designed to provide convenient control of household appliances through an Android mobile application. The system uses Arduino to receive commands from the application and control connected devices. It aims to improve convenience, accessibility, and efficient appliance management at home.",
      "categoryId": 3,
      "adviser": "JOHN VIANNEY V. MANUEL",
      "members": "CALONGE, JEHOSAPHAT D.\nPIOQUINTO, JEREMY L.\nCARDENAS, ANGEL R.\nTAGARA, PHINKIE R.\nREYES, MATTHEW B.\nDAYRITH, MELANIE V.\nBRAVO, JERICHO P.",
      "features": "Research paradigm\nRapid Application Development Life Cycle\nOpening the Garage Door\nClosing the Garage Door\nSwitching the Light On\nSwitching the Light Off\nSwitching the Celling Fan On\nSwitching the Celling Fan Off\nSwitching the Household Appliance Off",
      "research": "Home Automation Android application Using Arduino",
      "schoolYear": "2023-2024",
      "fileUrl": "/manus-storage/projects/1/1790353363474-Adobe-Scan-Sep-26-2026_26dbf162.pdf",
      "fileKey": "projects/1/1790353363474-Adobe-Scan-Sep-26-2026_26dbf162.pdf",
      "fileName": "Adobe-Scan-Sep-26-2026.pdf",
      "fileType": "application/pdf",
      "uploadedBy": 1,
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-25T16:22:43.494Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-25T16:22:59.560Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "TODDLER'S LEARNING GAME",
      "abstract": "This study focuses on the mental development of toddlers (3-6 y/o). Educational games are often used in a teaching approach known as game-based learning. The goal of this study is to educate and teach the toddlers and promote simple vocabulary.",
      "categoryId": 3,
      "adviser": "Mr. John Vianney V. Manuel",
      "members": "Duguinay, Gonoroso III C.\nGanaden, Cherry Ann D.\nBallaros Markshano G.\nBallado, Rogelio R.\nBernal, Jovolyn U.\nCorbillon, AJ A.",
      "features": "Game Notice for Parents\nGame Category Selection\nAnimal Learning\nColor Learning\nLetter Learning\nNumber Learning (1–10)\nShape Learning\nNext and Previous Navigation\nAnimal Selection\nColor Selection\nLetter Selection\nNumber Selection\nShape Selection\nOffline Use (No Internet Required)\nMobile-Based Learning Game",
      "research": "The Home Automation Android Application Using Arduino is designed to provide convenient control of household appliances through an Android mobile application. The system uses Arduino to receive commands from the application and control connected devices. It aims to improve convenience, accessibility, and efficient appliance management at home.",
      "schoolYear": "2024-2025",
      "fileUrl": "/manus-storage/projects/1/1790356467089-TODDLERS-LEARNING-GAME__3__4c8abb22.pdf",
      "fileKey": "projects/1/1790356467089-TODDLERS-LEARNING-GAME__3__4c8abb22.pdf",
      "fileName": "TODDLERS-LEARNING-GAME (3).pdf",
